From: RTP-LLM build owners <rtp-llm@alibaba-inc.com>
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] bazel: retire //external binds, map dep names to real labels

This repo retired bind()/the //external package, but grpc's bazel helpers still
route external_deps through the retired bind targets (//external:cares,
//external:protobuf, //external:protocol_compiler, ...), which no longer resolve.

Map each external dep name to the real label the retired bind pointed at
(boringssl / nanopb / protobuf(+lib,+headers) / zlib / absl / googletest via
_EXTERNAL_DEP_LABELS, cares special-cased to @com_github_cares_cares//:ares,
protoc to @com_google_protobuf//:protoc). grpc's unprovided test and optional
plugin dependencies point at explicit analysis-fail stubs in //deps; any name
not in the map (grpc's python-test-only "twisted"/"yaml", "address_sorting", or
a future addition) routes to @rtp_llm//deps:grpc_unmapped_absent, which fails at
analysis of the specific target that needs it rather than failing package
loading for everyone via a load-time fail().

Enumerated external_deps universe (scan of every external_deps=[...] in grpc's
BUILD files at rev 109c5707): absl-base, absl-time, address_sorting, benchmark,
cares, gflags, gmock, gtest, libssl, nanopb, opencensus-stats,
opencensus-stats-test, opencensus-trace, protobuf, protobuf_clib,
protobuf_headers, twisted, yaml, zlib. Of these, address_sorting/twisted/yaml
are only reached by targets outside RTP-LLM's C++ build graph, so they resolve
to the absent stub; re-scan on any grpc upgrade.

Upstream tracking: not filed — the map encodes this repo's label choices against
a 2019-era grpc commit (109c5707); upstream's bazel dep handling has moved on, so
there is no hunk upstream could take. Re-verify on any grpc upgrade; if the new
rev no longer references //external:, drop this patch.

Regression cover: every compile leg on pipeline 1346 builds @grpc from source,
so an unresolvable or mis-mapped label fails analysis there.

Note: patch is generated without a/b prefixes, same as 0001 in this patch list.
---
diff --git bazel/grpc_build_system.bzl bazel/grpc_build_system.bzl
--- bazel/grpc_build_system.bzl
+++ bazel/grpc_build_system.bzl
@@ -34,6 +34,26 @@
         "//:windows_msvc": [],
         "//conditions:default": a,
     })
+
+# bind()/the //external package are retired in this repo; map external dep
+# names to the real labels the retired binds pointed at (rtp_llm patch).
+_EXTERNAL_DEP_LABELS = {
+    "absl-base": "@com_google_absl//absl/base",
+    "absl-time": "@com_google_absl//absl/time",
+    "benchmark": "@rtp_llm//deps:grpc_benchmark_absent",
+    "gflags": "@rtp_llm//deps:grpc_gflags_absent",
+    "gmock": "@com_google_googletest//:gmock",
+    "gtest": "@com_google_googletest//:gtest",
+    "libssl": "@boringssl//:ssl",
+    "nanopb": "@com_github_nanopb_nanopb//:nanopb",
+    "opencensus-stats": "@rtp_llm//deps:grpc_opencensus_stats_absent",
+    "opencensus-stats-test": "@rtp_llm//deps:grpc_opencensus_stats_test_absent",
+    "opencensus-trace": "@rtp_llm//deps:grpc_opencensus_trace_absent",
+    "protobuf": "@com_google_protobuf//:protobuf",
+    "protobuf_clib": "@com_google_protobuf//:protoc_lib",
+    "protobuf_headers": "@com_google_protobuf//:protobuf_headers",
+    "zlib": "@zlib_archive//:zlib",
+}

 def _get_external_deps(external_deps):
     ret = []
@@ -43,10 +54,12 @@
         elif dep == "cares":
             ret += select({
                 "//:grpc_no_ares": [],
-                "//conditions:default": ["//external:cares"],
+                "//conditions:default": ["@com_github_cares_cares//:ares"],
             })
         else:
-            ret += ["//external:" + dep]
+            # Unmapped names (grpc's python-test-only twisted/yaml, address_sorting, or a
+            # future addition) route to an analysis-time absent stub, not a load-time fail().
+            ret += [_EXTERNAL_DEP_LABELS.get(dep, "@rtp_llm//deps:grpc_unmapped_absent")]
     return ret

 def _maybe_update_cc_library_hdrs(hdrs):
diff --git bazel/cc_grpc_library.bzl bazel/cc_grpc_library.bzl
--- bazel/cc_grpc_library.bzl
+++ bazel/cc_grpc_library.bzl
@@ -53,7 +53,7 @@
         **kwargs
     )
     grpc_deps  = ["@com_github_grpc_grpc//:grpc++_codegen_proto",
-                  "//external:protobuf"]
+                  "@com_google_protobuf//:protobuf"]
     native.cc_library(
         name = name,
         srcs = [":" + codegen_grpc_target, ":" + codegen_target],
@@ -66,6 +66,6 @@
         name = name,
         srcs = [":" + codegen_target],
         hdrs = [":" + codegen_target],
-        deps = deps + ["//external:protobuf"],
+        deps = deps + ["@com_google_protobuf//:protobuf"],
         **kwargs
     )
diff --git bazel/generate_cc.bzl bazel/generate_cc.bzl
